<title>EGYPT: 15 drown when minibus falls in Egyptian canal.</title>
<headline>15 drown when minibus falls in Egyptian canal.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fifteen Egyptians drowned on Sunday when a minibus went off the road and fell into an irrigation canal south of Cairo, a government newspaper said.</p>
<p>The driver and three passengers were injured in the accident, which took place on the outskirts of the Nile valley town of Beni Suef, the newspaper al-Akhbar reported.</p>
